[
    {
        "text": "\u7b2c\u4e8c\u5173\uff08\u524d\uff09",
        "tag": "header",
        "key": "title_test",
        "is_skippable": true,
        "fit_mode": "BLACK_MASK"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$darkalley_intro",
        "key": "$darkalley_loop",
        "volume": 0.8,
        "crossfade": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The shots are coming from above? Are they up on the overpass?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "text": "How high is the angle of attack? Where could they be shooting from?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "text": "Doesn't matter. First I've got to\u2014\u2014!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_park",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1#4"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 8,
        "ystrength": 6,
        "vibrato": 20,
        "randomness": 20,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Nng\u2014\u2014!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oof!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "I- I'm okay. What's this...? It's sticky...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "text": "A Sauin candle? Real lucky these were here...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_213_mostma_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You got one stuck in your horn too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1#2",
        "name2": "char_213_mostma_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh? Oh, thanks. I guess I better yank it... out\u2014\u2014!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1#2",
        "name2": "char_213_mostma_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't move, candle boy.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "Quiet. Take cover behind that crate.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_soldiersrun",
        "volume": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_031",
        "name2": "avg_npc_031",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "We lost Fronzo's signal. Oughta be around here somewhere!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_031",
        "name2": "avg_npc_031",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Penguin Logistics is here too. Tell the boss as soon as you spot the target.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_soldiersrun",
        "volume": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_213_mostma_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You can come out.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1#4",
        "name2": "char_213_mostma_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, okay...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "text": "I appreciate your help, but you really don't wanna get mixed up in this. You better go somewhere safe.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1#4",
        "name2": "char_213_mostma_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I'd love to. It's been a while since I had a trip to Lungmen. But a job's a job...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1#4",
        "name2": "char_213_mostma_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Considering how I found you, I'm guessing your deal with Penguin Logistics isn't going so well?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1#4",
        "name2": "char_213_mostma_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...you could say that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "text": "Err, who are you, exactly? I get the feeling you're not a typical passer-by.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1",
        "name2": "char_213_mostma_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Calm down. Let's just say I'm not your enemy.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "Whoops, they're coming back. Hide.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_031",
        "name2": "avg_npc_031",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Mamma mia! Those Penguin bastards got Fronzo! What're we gonna do?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_031",
        "name2": "avg_npc_031",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "That Bison kid's all alone. This could be our big break.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_031",
        "name2": "avg_npc_031",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Can we really just yoink him in the middle of downtown Lungmen?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_031",
        "name2": "avg_npc_031",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Mr. Capone says as long as we do it nice and quiet-like, hold off on the guns and bombs, Lungmen won't make a fuss.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso B"
    },
    {
        "text": "Nobody's gonna go looking in those filthy old alleyways, eh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_031",
        "name2": "avg_npc_031",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Then we'll be the backup, you find the kid. Capiche?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_213_mostma_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, we can't stay here. Let's get going.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let's see... over there. Let's say hello.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$marketplace_intro",
        "key": "$marketplace_loop",
        "volume": 0.8,
        "crossfade": 4
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 1.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_105_emper",
        "name2": "char_201_moeshd#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Ya find Bison yet, baws?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Croissant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_105_emper",
        "name2": "char_201_moeshd#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm wearin' shades, not binoculars. Gimme some space!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Emperor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_105_emper"
    },
    {
        "text": "Aight... I see 'im. Waving at me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Emperor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_103_angel_1#8"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well let's go get him, then come back and ask this guy what they're up to.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_031"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 8,
        "ystrength": 6,
        "vibrato": 20,
        "randomness": 20,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Mmmf\u2014\u2014 Mmmh\u2014\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_105_emper"
    },
    {
        "text": "Nah.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Emperor"
    },
    {
        "text": "Looks like our lucky little Bison had a smooth landing. He can get hisself back here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Emperor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_105_emper",
        "name2": "char_201_moeshd#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Um... he took a forty-foot drop onto a smooth landin'? How's that?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Croissant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_103_angel_1#7",
        "name2": "char_105_emper",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "And the bad guys are kinda hunting for him. You sure we shouldn't go get him?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_105_emper"
    },
    {
        "text": "She's got him.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Emperor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_103_angel_1#6"
    },
    {
        "text": "...She's back?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_102_texas_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Exusiai, stay focused.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "There they are! We gotta spring Fronzo!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_103_angel_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sigh. There's just no end to you people.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 1.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_213_mostma_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I think we lost them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "So what's Texas and the girls gotten themselves into this time? Who are they fighting now?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1#4",
        "name2": "char_213_mostma_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Can I really trust you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1#4",
        "name2": "char_213_mostma_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I guess I better introduce myself. I'm Mostima. A Messenger for Penguin Logistics.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1#4",
        "name2": "char_213_mostma_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I think that makes me your colleague, for now. I usually work alone though.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mostima"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1#2",
        "name2": "char_213_mostma_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...Mostima. I've heard that name from my father before.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Not to mention a Sankta with black horns... the rumors were true. Better not ask about them though...)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1#2",
        "name2": "char_213_mostma_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh...? Good things I hope?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mostima"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1",
        "name2": "char_213_mostma_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Erm... how should I say...? Just baseless rumors...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "text": "And after you saved me like that, I have no reason to doubt you. Sorry.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1",
        "name2": "char_213_mostma_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't worry about it. You got nothing to apologize for.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mostima"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1",
        "name2": "char_213_mostma_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Thanks... Now we should share our intelligence... although I'm still pretty confused.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "text": "Basically, Penguin Logistics is in some kind of conflict with an arm of the Siracusan mafia.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1",
        "name2": "char_213_mostma_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Right. Got it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mostima"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1#2",
        "name2": "char_213_mostma_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh? You got it already?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1#2",
        "name2": "char_213_mostma_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't need any more. You need to stop thinking so much. Trust your instincts. That's the Penguin Logistics way.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mostima"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1",
        "name2": "char_213_mostma_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh. So the trick is to just stop thinking, huh...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1",
        "name2": "char_213_mostma_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "They're a very special bunch. Common sense doesn't really work here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mostima"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1",
        "name2": "char_213_mostma_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...What about you, Mostima?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1",
        "name2": "char_213_mostma_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you always this direct with people?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mostima"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1",
        "name2": "char_213_mostma_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I- I think so.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1",
        "name2": "char_213_mostma_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "We need to get moving.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mostima"
    },
    {
        "text": "Follow me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mostima"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_lmstreet_1",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 1.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_031",
        "name2": "avg_npc_031",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Eyo, you found the target yet?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_031",
        "name2": "avg_npc_031",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "There's too many people. Hey, I'm walkin' here!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_031",
        "name2": "avg_npc_031",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "C'mon, let's check somewhere else.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mafioso"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 1.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "...I don't think they saw us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1#4",
        "name2": "char_213_mostma_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Just keep going like this, and we'll figure out a way to meet back up with the others.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mostima"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1#4",
        "name2": "char_213_mostma_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Right.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1#4",
        "name2": "char_213_mostma_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hm.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mostima"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
